---
const parts = [
  { code: "AFG", label: "Country", note: "ISO3 code" },
  { code: "001", label: "Admin 1", note: "First province" },
  { code: "012", label: "Admin 2", note: "Twelfth district" },
  { code: "003", label: "Admin 3", note: "Third sub-district" },
];
---

<figure class="anatomy">
  <div class="code" role="img" aria-label="Example P-code AFG.001.012.003, broken into its parts">
    {parts.map((p, i) => (
      <>
        {i > 0 && (
          <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">
            .
          </span>
        )}
        <span class="part" style={`--i: ${i}`}>
          <b>{p.code}</b>
          <span class="label">{p.label}</span>
          <span class="note">{p.note}</span>
        </span>
      </>
    ))}
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Dots separate the levels. After the country code, each level is a three-digit number counted
    within the unit above it.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .anatomy {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--brand-primary--lighter);
    border-radius: var(--brand-radius);
    background: var(--cd-white);
  }
  .code {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  .part {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    min-width: 6.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .part b {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--brand-radius--sm);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--cd-white);
    background: color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--brand-primary--dark) calc(100% - var(--i) * 22%),
      var(--brand-primary)
    );
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .dot {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding-top: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-primary--text);
  }
  .label {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--cd-grey--900);
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--brand-grey--text);
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .anatomy {
      padding: 1.25rem 0.75rem 1rem;
    }
    .part {
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .part b {
      padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .dot {
      padding-top: 0.2rem;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
    .note {
      display: none;
    }
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--cd-grey--800);
  }
</style>
